<title>INDIA: India Apr-Jun refinery output rises to 15.95 mln T.</title>
<headline>India Apr-Jun refinery output rises to 15.95 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India refinery production during April-June 1997 rose to 15.95 million tonnes from 15.27 million tonnes in the corresponding period in 1996, a Petroleum Ministry document obtained by Reuters on Thursday said.</p>
</text>
